cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. The version field names the
  release series; because the PyPI and npm artifacts published under 2.4.1 were
  built from different commits, prefer citing the exact commit or tag you
  actually used, and name the registry in your methods section.
type: software
title: "Plan Auditor: independent verification supervisor for AI coding agents"
abstract: >-
  Plan Auditor turns an AI agent's claim that work is complete into a checkable
  fact. Every step must carry at least one deterministic behavioural check that a
  separate process re-runs in a fresh subprocess; the result is appended to a
  SHA-256 hash-chained evidence log. The plan's verification contract is sealed on
  host approval and may only be strengthened afterwards, and the final gate fails
  closed until every active plan has an intact contract and a fresh deterministic
  audit. There is no language model in the verification path.
authors:
